category: Libs
requires: liballegro5.2 pkg-config flac-devel libdumb-devel libfreetype-devel libGLU-devel libjpeg-devel libopenal-devel libopenmpt-devel libopusfile-devel libphysfs-devel libtheora-devel libwebp-devel libXcursor-devel libXi-devel libXinerama-devel libXrandr-devel libXss-devel
sdesc: "Game programming library (development)"
ldesc: "Allegro is a cross-platform library mainly aimed at video game and multimedia
programming. It handles common, low-level tasks such as creating windows,
accepting user input, loading data, drawing images, playing sounds, etc. and
generally abstracting away the underlying platform. However, Allegro is not a
game engine: you are free to design and structure your program as you like."
external-source: allegro

